  "contracts": {
    "append_input": "An actual length-M BetaPrefixEqual from C to D and actual BetaAt(D,M,c); no append conclusion is assumed.",
    "all_index": "At every natural index, three actual convolution coefficients with genuine diagonal-sum/residue witnesses satisfy canonical FpAdd for C, its padded singleton constant, and D.",
    "alignment": "Prime(p), c<p, Coeff(A,L), Coeff(P,N) construct 10 real beta-code witnesses for Shift(P), Scale(c,A), both leading pads, and Add at H=L+S N.",
    "principal": "Prime(p), actual P=A*C of length N, actual Q=A*D of length K, and actual alignment witnesses imply formal Equivalent(Q,K;R,L+S N), not raw code equality. No universal K=S N premise or conclusion.",
    "constructor": "Prime(p), c<p and an actual P=A*C construct the real appended D, proper product Q, all alignment witnesses, and the proved formal equivalence.",
    "cases": "Empty left/right factors, zero scalar, characteristic 2 with natural unit 1, unrelated reencodings, and free values beyond every represented prefix are covered. Append contracts require Prime(p); no composite-modulus append claim is made."
  },
